{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/7e8de01abf4bc3ba558c2406f1d9865e.avif?t=1768471212\" width=612 height=198 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a South Korean elementary school in 1999, \u300eCome to my party!\u300f is a black comedy visual novel that follows 10-year-old Jimin's quest for her first-ever birthday party. Through multiple paths and endings filled with both laughs and heart, step into a story that might just remind you of your own childhood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/bd09554c45ec6b9208e57658cf023014.poster.avif?t=1768471212\" width=626 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/bd09554c45ec6b9208e57658cf023014.webm?t=1768471212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/bd09554c45ec6b9208e57658cf023014.mp4?t=1768471212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Get elected as class president, and you'll get your birthday party.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When this opportunity falls into Jimin's lap, it feels like her first real chance to shine. Living in the shadow of her straight-A sister and adorable little brother, her mother's unexpected proposal might just be the key to finally having her moment. But can she pull it off? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/b19c0741892ae211a18167935d575e54.poster.avif?t=1768471212\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/b19c0741892ae211a18167935d575e54.webm?t=1768471212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/b19c0741892ae211a18167935d575e54.mp4?t=1768471212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late 90s Korean Slice of Life: Step back in time to experience the authentic atmosphere of a 1990s Korean elementary school.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Unique Endings: Your choices shape the story - will Jimin make the right friends? Become class president? Get her dream party? It's all in your hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Humor with Heart: A perfect blend of comedy and deeper themes that captures both the joy and growing pains of childhood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unforgettable Characters: Build relationships with a colorful cast of characters, each hiding their own secrets and stories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/4cf471eecfafb21e164fc2f9335356c3.poster.avif?t=1768471212\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/4cf471eecfafb21e164fc2f9335356c3.webm?t=1768471212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/4cf471eecfafb21e164fc2f9335356c3.mp4?t=1768471212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player's Goal:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Jimin as she navigates friendship, school politics, and family dynamics in her quest for the perfect birthday party. Every choice you make steers her story toward one of multiple possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to 1999, when your best friends were your whole world, in \u300eCome to my party!\u300f Help Jimin make her birthday wish come true!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/5ace393653b12d29908e3466d996e3da.poster.avif?t=1768471212\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/5ace393653b12d29908e3466d996e3da.webm?t=1768471212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/5ace393653b12d29908e3466d996e3da.mp4?t=1768471212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3003760?t=1768471212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/817c4aee86fd2c5e8f49af6c123cf85b98274353/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768471212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768471212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768471212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"depictions of domestic violence, teacher-perpetrated violence, bullying, and suicide"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003760/extras/7e8de